--- !u!114 &1478462783
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1478462775}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 40fe67fde4a4351409089804b4848b92, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _documentationText: 'YOLOv5 Instance Segmentation Example

    Real-time COCO
    instance segmentation using YOLOv5 with optional Unity Sentis or OpenCV DNN frameworks.

    

    Demonstrates:

    -
    Reading input frames via MultiSourceToMatHelper (webcam, video file, image file,
    or GPU readback)

    - Loading YOLOv5 ONNX/Sentis segmentation model and class
    names from StreamingAssets

    - Toggling Sentis vs OpenCV DNN inference and
    async segmentation via MatSingleFlightSyncAsyncRunner

    - Converting RGBA
    frames to BGR, running YOLOv5InstanceSegmenterMultiBackend, and visualizing masks
    and detection boxes

    

    OpenCV classes and APIs used:

    - Mat, Size,
    Scalar, Point

    - Imgproc: cvtColor

    - YOLOv5InstanceSegmenterMultiBackend,
    MatSingleFlightSyncAsyncRunner, MultiBackendDnn

    - MultiSourceToMatHelper,
    OpenCVMatUnityUtils

    

    [Tested Models]

    yolov5n-seg.onnx'
  AlignmentSetting: 0
